---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const email = 'carlos@fathomforge.dev';
---
<Base title="Contact" og="contact" description="How to reach Carlos M. at fathomforge.">
  <section class="shell">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
      <h1>Get in touch</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        The fastest way to reach me is email. I read everything and reply to most things,
        usually within a few days.
      </p>

      <a class="email" href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>

      <p class="note">
        No form, no tracking pixel, no autoresponder sequence. It goes straight to my inbox.
      </p>

      <hr />

      <h2>Worth writing about</h2>
      <ul class="reasons">
        <li>
          <strong>Security issues in my tools.</strong> Please use the disclosure process in
          <a href="https://github.com/fathomforge/belay/blob/main/SECURITY.md" rel="noopener">SECURITY.md</a>
          rather than a public issue.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Bugs and feature requests.</strong>
          <a href="https://github.com/fathomforge/belay/issues" rel="noopener">GitHub issues</a>
          are better than email — other people benefit from the answer.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Corrections.</strong> Wrong numbers, bad reasoning, a claim that doesn't
          survive contact with your setup — send it and I'll amend the post.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Anything else.</strong> If you're working on something in this area, I'm
          always glad to hear about it.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  h1 { margin-bottom: .8rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0; }
  .prose p { color: var(--fg-muted); }

  .email {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 2rem 0 .75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.6vw, 1.45rem);
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding-bottom: .3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent-dim);
    transition: border-color .25s var(--ease);
  }
  .email:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }
  .note { font-size: .875rem; color: var(--fg-faint); }

  .reasons { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 1.1rem; }
  .reasons li { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .reasons strong { color: var(--fg); font-weight: 500; }
  .prose a { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
